{"arm": "vs", "model": "anthropic/claude-haiku-5.5", "i": 1, "finish": "stop", "dirs": [{"direction": "Editorial paper: warm off-white stock, serif display type, ink-rule dividers, and a restrained teal accent, like a well-made weekly planner or print journal", "probability": 0.3}, {"direction": "Swiss week-grid: the product itself is the hero, a bold Monday-to-Friday grid with strict sans-serif type, hairline rules, and color used only to mark who owns each block", "probability": 0.25}, {"direction": "Bioluminescent tidal dark mode: deep navy-to-teal gradients, glowing dots representing teammates, and soft motion suggesting water and light", "probability": 0.15}, {"direction": "Playful sticky-note board: a collaborative whiteboard feel with slightly rotated colored cards, hand-drawn-style accents, and a casual, friendly voice", "probability": 0.2}, {"direction": "Brutalist monospace utility: raw black-and-white layout, heavy borders, monospace labels, and a single saturated highlight color, aimed at developer-minded small teams", "probability": 0.1}], "pick": {"direction": "Editorial paper: warm off-white stock, serif display type, ink-rule dividers, and a restrained teal accent, like a well-made weekly planner or print journal", "probability": 0.3}, "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tidepool \u2014 Plan the week together</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Tidepool helps small teams agree on the week ahead, in one shared page, before Monday starts.\">\n<style>\n  :root {\n    --paper: #f5f0e4;\n    --paper-deep: #ebe4d2;\n    --paper-light: #fbf8f0;\n    --ink: #1c1a16;\n    --ink-soft: #4a463d;\n    --ink-faint: #837c6e;\n    --rule: #1c1a16;\n    --hair: #c9c0a9;\n    --teal: #1e6b66;\n    --teal-ink: #14524e;\n    --teal-wash: #dcebe6;\n    --serif-display: \"Iowan Old Style\", \"Palatino Linotype\", Palatino, \"Book Antiqua\", Georgia, serif;\n    --serif-text: Georgia, \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n    --sans-small: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    --measure: 64rem;\n  }\n\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n  html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }\n\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    background: var(--paper);\n    color: var(--ink);\n    font-family: var(--serif-text);\n    font-size: 1.0625rem;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n  }\n\n  /* Subtle paper grain using layered gradients, no external assets */\n  body::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: fixed;\n    inset: 0;\n    pointer-events: none;\n    z-index: -1;\n    background-image:\n      radial-gradient(rgba(120, 100, 60, 0.035) 1px, transparent 1px),\n      radial-gradient(rgba(120, 100, 60, 0.025) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 3px 3px, 7px 7px;\n    background-position: 0 0, 2px 3px;\n  }\n\n  a { color: var(--ink); text-decoration-thickness: 1px; text-underline-offset: 0.2em; }\n  a:hover { color: var(--teal); }\n  a:focus-visible, summary:focus-visible, button:focus-visible {\n    outline: 2px solid var(--teal);\n    outline-offset: 3px;\n  }\n\n  img, svg { display: block; max-width: 100%; }\n\n  .wrap {\n    width: min(100% - 2.5rem, var(--measure));\n    margin-inline: auto;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Typography helpers ---------- */\n  .kicker {\n    font-family: var(--sans-small);\n    font-size: 0.72rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.16em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--teal);\n    margin: 0 0 0.9rem;\n  }\n\n  .display {\n    font-family: var(--serif-display);\n    font-weight: 500;\n    letter-spacing: -0.015em;\n    line-height: 1.04;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  h2.display {\n    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.9rem);\n  }\n\n  h3.display {\n    font-size: 1.45rem;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n    letter-spacing: -0.005em;\n  }\n\n  .lede {\n    font-size: 1.2rem;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n    max-width: 36ch;\n  }\n\n  .small {\n    font-family: var(--sans-small);\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n    color: var(--ink-faint);\n    letter-spacing: 0.01em;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Rules ---------- */\n  .rule-heavy { border: 0; height: 3px; background: var(--rule); margin: 0; }\n  .rule-thin  { border: 0; height: 1px; background: var(--rule); margin: 0; }\n  .rule-double {\n    border: 0;\n    height: 5px;\n    margin: 0;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);\n    border-bottom: 3px solid var(--rule);\n  }\n  .rule-hair { border: 0; height: 1px; background: var(--hair); margin: 0; }\n\n  /* ---------- Buttons ---------- */\n  .btn {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.6rem;\n    font-family: var(--sans-small);\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: 0.01em;\n    padding: 0.85rem 1.25rem;\n    border: 1px solid var(--teal);\n    background: var(--teal);\n    color: var(--paper-light);\n    text-decoration: none;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n    transition: background 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;\n    cursor: pointer;\n  }\n  .btn:hover { background: var(--teal-ink); border-color: var(--teal-ink); color: var(--paper-light); }\n\n  .btn-ghost {\n    background: transparent;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    border-color: var(--ink);\n  }\n  .btn-ghost:hover { background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper-light); border-color: var(--ink); }\n\n  .text-link {\n    font-family: var(--sans-small);\n    font-size: 0.95rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    text-decoration-color: var(--teal);\n    text-decoration-thickness: 2px;\n    text-underline-offset: 0.3em;\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Masthead ---------- */\n  .edition {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);\n    font-family: var(--sans-small);\n    font-size: 0.72rem;\n    letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n  }\n  .edition .wrap {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 1rem;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    padding-block: 0.55rem;\n  }\n\n  .masthead {\n    padding-block: 1.4rem 1rem;\n  }\n  .masthead .wrap {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 1.5rem;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n\n  .wordmark {\n    font-family: var(--serif-display);\n    font-size: 2rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n    color: var(--ink);\n  }\n  .wordmark-mark {\n    width: 1.05rem;\n    height: 1.05rem;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    border: 2px solid var(--teal);\n    position: relative;\n    top: 0.05rem;\n  }\n  .wordmark-mark::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 50%;\n    top: 50%;\n    width: 0.35rem;\n    height: 0.35rem;\n    background: var(--teal);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n  }\n\n  .nav {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 1.6rem;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n  .nav a {\n    font-family: var(--sans-small);\n    font-size: 0.92rem;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n  }\n  .nav a:hover { color: var(--teal); }\n\n  .nav .btn { padding: 0.55rem 0.95rem; font-size: 0.88rem; }\n\n  /* ---------- Hero ---------- */\n  .hero {\n    padding-block: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5.5rem) clamp(3rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);\n  }\n  .hero-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;\n    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .hero h1 {\n    font-size: clamp(2.9rem, 6.6vw, 5.1rem);\n    line-height: 0.98;\n    letter-spacing: -0.025em;\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n  }\n  .hero h1 em {\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: var(--teal);\n    font-weight: 400;\n  }\n  .hero .lede { margin-bottom: 2rem; }\n  .cta-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 1.25rem 1.6rem;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n  .hero-note {\n    margin-top: 1.4rem;\n  }\n\n  /* Planner spread mock (pure CSS) */\n  .spread {\n    background: var(--paper-light);\n    border: 1px solid var(--rule);\n    box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 var(--paper-deep), 6px 6px 0 1px var(--rule);\n    padding: 1.1rem 1.1rem 1.25rem;\n    position: relative;\n    transform: rotate(-0.6deg);\n  }\n  .spread-head {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: baseline;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);\n    padding-bottom: 0.55rem;\n    margin-bottom: 0.7rem;\n  }\n  .spread-head .display {\n    font-size: 1.35rem;\n  }\n  .spread-head .small { color: var(--ink-soft); }\n\n  .week {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);\n    gap: 0;\n    border: 1px solid var(--rule);\n  }\n  .day {\n    min-height: 10.5rem;\n    border-right: 1px solid var(--hair);\n    padding: 0.5rem 0.45rem;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 0.4rem;\n  }\n  .day:last-child { border-right: 0; }\n  .day-name {\n    font-family: var(--sans-small);\n    font-size: 0.66rem;\n    letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--ink-faint);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hair);\n    padding-bottom: 0.3rem;\n  }\n  .day.today .day-name { color: var(--teal); font-weight: 700; }\n  .chip {\n    font-family: var(--sans-small);\n    font-size: 0.7rem;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    padding: 0.35rem 0.4rem;\n    border-left: 3px solid var(--teal);\n    background: var(--teal-wash);\n    color: var(--ink);\n  }\n  .chip.ink { border-left-color: var(--ink); background: var(--paper-deep); }\n  .chip.dash { background: transparent; border: 1px dashed var(--ink-faint); border-left: 3px solid var(--ink-faint); color: var(--ink-soft); }\n  .chip b { font-weight: 700; display: block; font-size: 0.66rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }\n\n  .spread-foot {\n    margin-top: 0.8rem;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 0.75rem;\n    font-family: var(--sans-small);\n    font-size: 0.72rem;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n  .avatars { display: flex; }\n  .avatars span {\n    width: 1.5rem;\n    height: 1.5rem;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    border: 1px solid var(--ink);\n    background: var(--paper);\n    display: grid;\n    place-items: center;\n    font-size: 0.6rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin-left: -0.4rem;\n    color: var(--ink);\n  }\n  .avatars span:first-child { margin-left: 0; }\n  .avatars span:nth-child(2) { background: var(--teal-wash); }\n  .avatars span:nth-child(3) { background: var(--paper-deep); }\n  .avatars span:nth-child(4) { background: var(--teal); color: var(--paper-light); }\n\n  .stamp {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -0.9rem;\n    right: -0.6rem;\n    background: var(--paper);\n    border: 1.5px solid var(--teal);\n    color: var(--teal);\n    font-family: var(--sans-small);\n    font-size: 0.68rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    padding: 0.4rem 0.6rem;\n    transform: rotate(4deg);\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Sections ---------- */\n  section { position: relative; }\n  .section {\n    padding-block: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 5.5rem);\n  }\n  .section-head {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;\n    gap: 2rem;\n    align-items: start;\n    margin-bottom: 2.75rem;\n  }\n  .section-head .lede { margin: 0; }\n  .section-index {\n    font-family: var(--sans-small);\n    font-size: 0.78rem;\n    letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n    color: var(--ink-faint);\n    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;\n  }\n\n  /* Feature columns */\n  .features {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    border-top: 3px solid var(--rule);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);\n  }\n  .feature {\n    padding: 2rem 1.75rem 2.25rem;\n    border-right: 1px solid var(--rule);\n  }\n  .feature:last-child { border-right: 0; }\n  .feature-num {\n    font-family: var(--serif-display);\n    font-size: 2.4rem;\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: var(--teal);\n    line-height: 1;\n    margin: 0 0 1rem;\n  }\n  .feature h3 { margin-bottom: 0.7rem; }\n  .feature p {\n    margin: 0;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n    font-size: 1rem;\n  }\n\n  /* Steps */\n  .steps {\n    list-style: none;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    counter-reset: step;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);\n  }\n  .step {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 5rem 1fr 1.4fr;\n    gap: 1.5rem;\n    padding: 1.6rem 0;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hair);\n    align-items: baseline;\n  }\n  .step-n {\n    font-family: var(--serif-display);\n    font-size: 2.6rem;\n    line-height: 1;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    font-weight: 400;\n  }\n  .step h3 { margin: 0; }\n  .step p { margin: 0; color: var(--ink-soft); }\n\n  /* Pull quote band */\n  .band {\n    background: var(--ink);\n    color: var(--paper);\n    padding-block: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 5rem);\n  }\n  .band .wrap {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;\n    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);\n    align-items: start;\n  }\n  .quote-mark {\n    font-family: var(--serif-display);\n    font-size: 7rem;\n    line-height: 0.7;\n    color: var(--teal);\n    margin-top: 0.4rem;\n  }\n  .quote {\n    font-family: var(--serif-display);\n    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3.3vw, 2.5rem);\n    line-height: 1.25;\n    font-style: italic;\n    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;\n    max-width: 30ch;\n  }\n  .quote-attr {\n    font-family: var(--sans-small);\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    color: #bdb6a4;\n    letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n  }\n  .quote-attr strong { color: var(--paper); font-weight: 600; }\n\n  /* Pricing as a printed table */\n  .plans {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    font-family: var(--serif-text);\n  }\n  .plans th, .plans td {\n    text-align: left;\n    vertical-align: top;\n    padding: 1.4rem 1.25rem;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hair);\n  }\n  .plans thead th {\n    border-top: 3px solid var(--rule);\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);\n    padding-top: 1.1rem;\n    padding-bottom: 1.1rem;\n    font-family: var(--sans-small);\n    font-size: 0.72rem;\n    letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n  .plans thead th.feat-col { color: var(--teal); }\n  .plans tbody th {\n    font-family: var(--sans-small);\n    font-size: 0.9rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    width: 22%;\n    color: var(--ink);\n  }\n  .plans td { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 1rem; }\n  .plans td.yes::before { content: \"\u2713 \"; color: var(--teal); font-weight: 700; font-family: var(--sans-small); }\n  .plans td.no { color: var(--ink-faint); }\n  .plans td.no::before { content: \"\u2014 \"; }\n  .price {\n    font-family: var(--serif-display);\n    font-size: 2.6rem;\n    line-height: 1;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    display: block;\n    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\n    letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n  }\n  .price small {\n    font-family: var(--sans-small);\n    font-size: 0.8rem;\n    color: var(--ink-faint);\n    letter-spacing: 0;\n    margin-left: 0.2rem;\n  }\n  .plan-name {\n    font-family: var(--serif-display);\n    font-size: 1.35rem;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    display: block;\n    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;\n    text-transform: none;\n    letter-spacing: 0;\n  }\n  .plans .plan-cta { padding-top: 1.4rem; }\n  .plans .plans-foot-row td { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }\n\n  .feat-col-wash { background: var(--teal-wash); }\n  .plans td.feat-col-wash, .plans th.feat-col-wash { background: rgba(220, 235, 230, 0.55); }\n\n  /* FAQ */\n  .faq-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;\n    gap: 2rem;\n  }\n  .faq details {\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--hair);\n    padding: 1.15rem 0;\n  }\n  .faq details:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hair); }\n  .faq summary {\n    cursor: pointer;\n    list-style: none;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: baseline;\n    gap: 1.25rem;\n    font-family: var(--serif-display);\n    font-size: 1.3rem;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n  .faq summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\n  .faq summary::after {\n    content: \"+\";\n    font-family: var(--sans-small);\n    font-size: 1.3rem;\n    color: var(--teal);\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    transition: transform 0.15s ease;\n  }\n  .faq details[open] summary::after { content: \"\u2013\"; }\n  .faq details p {\n    margin: 0.85rem 0 0.25rem;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n    max-width: 58ch;\n  }\n\n  /* Closing CTA */\n  .closing {\n    text-align: center;\n    padding-block: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 6rem);\n  }\n  .closing h2 {\n    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5.5vw, 4rem);\n    line-height: 1.02;\n    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;\n    letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n  }\n  .closing h2 em { color: var(--teal); font-weight: 400; }\n  .closing p {\n    margin: 0 auto 2rem;\n    max-width: 42ch;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n  }\n  .closing .cta-row { justify-content: center; }\n\n  /* Footer / colophon */\n  .footer {\n    border-top: 3px solid var(--rule);\n    padding-block: 2rem 2.5rem;\n    font-family: var(--sans-small);\n    font-size: 0.85rem;\n    color: var(--ink-soft);\n  }\n  .footer .wrap {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;\n    gap: 2rem;\n  }\n  .footer h4 {\n    font-size: 0.7rem;\n    letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    margin: 0 0 0.8rem;\n  }\n  .footer ul { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  .footer li { margin-bottom: 0.45rem; }\n  .footer a { text-decoration: none; color: var(--ink-soft); }\n  .footer a:hover { color: var(--teal); }\n  .colophon {\n    margin-top: 2.25rem;\n    padding-top: 1rem;\n    border-top: 1px solid var(--hair);\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 1rem;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    font-size: 0.78rem;\n    color: var(--ink-faint);\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- Responsive ---------- */\n  @media (max-width: 960px) {\n    .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .spread { transform: none; max-width: 40rem; }\n    .section-head, .faq-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 1rem; }\n    .step { grid-template-columns: 3.5rem 1fr; }\n    .step p { grid-column: 2; }\n    .footer .wrap { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 760px) {\n    .features { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .feature { border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }\n    .feature:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }\n    .week { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .day { min-height: 0; border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hair); flex-direction: row; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }\n    .day:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }\n    .day-name { width: 5rem; border-bottom: 0; padding-bottom: 0; }\n    .day .chip { flex: 1 1 10rem; }\n    .band .wrap { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .quote-mark { font-size: 4.5rem; }\n    .plans thead { display: none; }\n    .plans, .plans tbody, .plans tr, .plans th, .plans td { display: block; width: 100%; }\n    .plans tr { border-top: 3px solid var(--rule); padding: 1.1rem 0; }\n    .plans th, .plans td { border: 0; padding: 0.35rem 0; }\n    .plans td::before { content: attr(data-label) \": \"; font-family: var(--sans-small); font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-faint); }\n    .plans td.yes::before, .plans td.no::before { content: attr(data-label) \": \"; }\n    .plans td.yes, .plans td.no { color: var(--ink-soft); }\n    .plans td.plan-cta::before { content: none; }\n    .plans td.feat-col-wash, .plans th.feat-col-wash { background: none; }\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 560px) {\n    .nav { gap: 1rem; }\n    .nav a.hide-sm { display: none; }\n    .footer .wrap { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .step { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0.5rem; }\n    .step p { grid-column: auto; }\n    .stamp { right: 0.4rem; }\n  }\n\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n    * { transition: none !important; }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<!-- Edition strip -->\n<div class=\"edition\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <span>Vol. 01 &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp; Issue 14</span>\n    <span>A planner for small teams</span>\n    <span>Est. for Mondays</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- Masthead -->\n<header class=\"masthead\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <a href=\"#top\" class=\"wordmark\" id=\"top\" aria-label=\"Tidepool home\">\n      <span class=\"wordmark-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n      Tidepool\n    </a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\" aria-label=\"Primary\">\n      <a href=\"#method\" class=\"hide-sm\">How it works</a>\n      <a href=\"#features\" class=\"hide-sm\">Features</a>\n      <a href=\"#pricing\">Pricing</a>\n      <a href=\"#questions\" class=\"hide-sm\">Questions</a>\n      <a href=\"#start\" class=\"btn\">Start a week</a>\n    </nav>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<hr class=\"rule-double\">\n\n<main>\n\n  <!-- Hero -->\n  <section class=\"hero\">\n    <div class=\"wrap hero-grid\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"kicker\">For teams of two to twelve</p>\n        <h1 class=\"display\">The week, agreed on <em>before</em> Monday starts.</h1>\n        <p class=\"lede\">Tidepool gives a small team one shared page for the week ahead: who owns what, what's blocked, and what can wait. Ten minutes on Friday replaces the Monday meeting nobody wanted.</p>\n        <div class=\"cta-row\">\n          <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#start\">Start your first week</a>\n          <a class=\"text-link\" href=\"#method\">See how a week runs</a>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"small hero-note\">Free for teams of up to four. No card required.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div aria-label=\"Example weekly planner\">\n        <div class=\"spread\">\n          <span class=\"stamp\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Agreed Fri</span>\n          <div class=\"spread-head\">\n            <span class=\"display\">Week 14</span>\n            <span class=\"small\">Mar 9 \u2013 13</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"week\">\n            <div class=\"day\">\n              <span class=\"day-name\">Mon</span>\n              <div class=\"chip\"><b>Priya</b>Client brief draft</div>\n              <div class=\"chip ink\"><b>Sam</b>Vendor call, 10:00</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"day today\">\n              <span class=\"day-name\">Tue</span>\n              <div class=\"chip\"><b>Jo</b>Ship onboarding copy</div>\n              <div class=\"chip dash\"><b>Open</b>Review slot</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"day\">\n              <span class=\"day-name\">Wed</span>\n              <div class=\"chip ink\"><b>Priya</b>Pricing sign-off</div>\n              <div class=\"chip\"><b>All</b>Team sync, 15 min</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"day\">\n              <span class=\"day-name\">Thu</span>\n              <div class=\"chip dash\"><b>Open</b>Focus block</div>\n              <div class=\"chip\"><b>Sam</b>Invoice run</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"day\">\n              <span class=\"day-name\">Fri</span>\n              <div class=\"chip ink\"><b>Jo</b>Demo to partners</div>\n              <div class=\"chip\"><b>All</b>Plan Week 15</div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"spread-foot\">\n            <div class=\"avatars\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <span>P</span><span>S</span><span>J</span><span>+1</span>\n            </div>\n            <span>4 of 4 have agreed</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <hr class=\"rule-heavy\">\n\n  <!-- Features -->\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"features\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"section-head\">\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"section-index\">\u00a7 01 &nbsp;Features</p>\n          <h2 class=\"display\">Three things, done with care.</h2>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"lede\">We left out the dashboards, the sprint boards, and the notification storms. What remains is a single page a team can read in under a minute.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"features\">\n        <article class=\"feature\">\n          <p class=\"feature-num\">i.</p>\n          <h3 class=\"display\">One page per week</h3>\n          <p>Every week is a sheet with five columns and no nesting. Assignments, blockers, and open slots sit side by side, so nobody has to ask where something lives.</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"feature\">\n          <p class=\"feature-num\">ii.</p>\n          <h3 class=\"display\">Agree, don't assume</h3>\n          <p>Each person marks their week as agreed on Friday. Anything still unmarked is flagged in plain language before Monday, while there is still time to fix it.</p>\n        </article>\n        <article class=\"feature\">\n          <p class=\"feature-num\">iii.</p>\n          <h3 class=\"display\">Carry over on purpose</h3>\n          <p>Unfinished work moves forward only when someone chooses to move it. Tidepool keeps a short record of what slipped and why, so patterns show up without a retrospective.</p>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <hr class=\"rule-thin\">\n\n  <!-- Method -->\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"method\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"section-head\">\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"section-index\">\u00a7 02 &nbsp;Method</p>\n          <h2 class=\"display\">How a week runs.</h2>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"lede\">A rhythm of four short moments. Most teams spend under fifteen minutes on the whole cycle.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <ol class=\"steps\">\n        <li class=\"step\">\n          <span class=\"step-n\">1</span>\n          <h3 class=\"display\">Open the sheet</h3>\n          <p>On Thursday, Tidepool opens next week's page and pulls in what carried over, what's due, and what was promised in conversation.</p>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"step\">\n          <span class=\"step-n\">2</span>\n          <h3 class=\"display\">Claim the work</h3>\n          <p>Each person places their own items on the grid. Nobody can assign work to someone else without that person seeing it first.</p>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"step\">\n          <span class=\"step-n\">3</span>\n          <h3 class=\"display\">Mark it agreed</h3>\n          <p>A single tap on Friday confirms the week. Open questions are surfaced as a short list, not buried in a thread.</p>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"step\">\n          <span class=\"step-n\">4</span>\n          <h3 class=\"display\">Begin on Monday</h3>\n          <p>The week is locked, shared, and visible. Changes after agreement are logged, so a shift is a decision, not a surprise.</p>\n        </li>\n      </ol>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Testimonial band -->\n  <section class=\"band\" aria-label=\"Testimonial\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <span class=\"quote-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&ldquo;</span>\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"quote\">We stopped having the Monday meeting. Now we have a Friday page, and it is the most honest document we make all week.</p>\n        <p class=\"quote-attr\"><strong>Marisol Okafor</strong> &nbsp;\u00b7&nbsp; Operations lead, a six-person design studio</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Pricing -->\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"pricing\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <div class=\"section-head\">\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"section-index\">\u00a7 03 &nbsp;Plans</p>\n          <h2 class=\"display\">Priced by the team, not the seat.</h2>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"lede\">Start free with a team of four. Move up when your week gets crowded, and not before.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <table class=\"plans\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"col\">Plan</th>\n            <th scope=\"col\">Starter</th>\n            <th scope=\"col\" class=\"feat-col\">Team</th>\n            <th scope=\"col\">Studio</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td></td>\n            <td data-label=\"Starter\"><span class=\"price\">$0</span><span class=\"small\">Forever free</span></td>\n            <td data-label=\"Team\" class=\"feat-col-wash\"><span class=\"price\">$6<small>per team / month</small></span><span class=\"small\">Billed yearly, or $8 monthly</span></td>\n            <td data-label=\"Studio\"><span class=\"price\">Let's talk</span><span class=\"small\">For more than twelve</span></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Team size</th>\n            <td data-label=\"Team size\">Up to 4</td>\n            <td data-label=\"Team size\" class=\"feat-col-wash\">Up to 12</td>\n            <td data-label=\"Team size\">Unlimited</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Weekly pages</th>\n            <td data-label=\"Weekly pages\" class=\"yes\">Current week</td>\n            <td data-label=\"Weekly pages\" class=\"yes feat-col-wash\">Full history</td>\n            <td data-label=\"Weekly pages\" class=\"yes\">Full history, exports</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Agreement and carry-over log</th>\n            <td data-label=\"Log\" class=\"no\">Not included</td>\n            <td data-label=\"Log\" class=\"yes feat-col-wash\">Included</td>\n            <td data-label=\"Log\" class=\"yes\">Included, with audit trail</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Workspace admin</th>\n            <td data-label=\"Admin\" class=\"no\">Not included</td>\n            <td data-label=\"Admin\" class=\"yes feat-col-wash\">Roles and guest access</td>\n            <td data-label=\"Admin\" class=\"yes\">SSO and roles</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Support</th>\n            <td data-label=\"Support\">Community</td>\n            <td data-label=\"Support\" class=\"feat-col-wash\">Email, two-day reply</td>\n            <td data-label=\"Support\">Named contact</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"plans-foot-row\">\n            <td></td>\n            <td class=\"plan-cta\" data-label=\"Action\"><a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"#start\">Start free</a></td>\n            <td class=\"plan-cta feat-col-wash\" data-label=\"Action\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"#start\">Start a Team trial</a></td>\n            <td class=\"plan-cta\" data-label=\"Action\"><a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"#start\">Talk to us</a></td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <hr class=\"rule-thin\">\n\n  <!-- FAQ -->\n  <section class=\"section\" id=\"questions\">\n    <div class=\"wrap faq-grid\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"section-index\">\u00a7 04 &nbsp;Questions</p>\n        <h2 class=\"display\">Good questions, answered plainly.</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq\">\n        <details open>\n          <summary>Does everyone on the team need a paid seat?</summary>\n          <p>No. Pricing is per team. Anyone you invite to a Tidepool workspace can read and edit their own items, and that stays true on every plan.</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>Will this replace our project tracker?</summary>\n          <p>It is not meant to. Tidepool covers the week: who is doing what, and when. Long-running projects, tickets, and documentation can stay where they already live. Link them from a week item if you need to.</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>What happens if we change the plan after agreeing to it?</summary>\n          <p>You can always edit. Changes made after agreement are logged with a timestamp and the name of the person who made them, so the week stays honest without locking anyone out.</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>Can we bring our own calendar?</summary>\n          <p>Yes. Tidepool can read busy blocks from common calendars so the open slots on the grid match what is actually free. It never writes to your calendar without asking.</p>\n        </details>\n        <details>\n          <summary>Where is our data kept?</summary>\n          <p>Your workspace data is encrypted in transit and at rest. You can export every week as a plain document at any time, and you can delete a workspace whenever you choose.</p>\n        </details>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Closing CTA -->\n  <section class=\"closing\" id=\"start\">\n    <div class=\"wrap\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">Next week, sorted by Friday</p>\n      <h2 class=\"display\">Start with one page.<br><em>Fill it in together.</em></h2>\n      <p>Create a workspace in under two minutes, invite your team, and draft this week's sheet. It takes less time than the meeting it replaces.</p>\n      <div class=\"cta-row\">\n        <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#top\">Create your workspace</a>\n        <a class=\"text-link\" href=\"#features\">Look at the features again</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n</main>\n\n<footer class=\"footer\">\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div>\n      <span class=\"wordmark\" style=\"font-size:1.5rem;\">\n        <span class=\"wordmark-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        Tidepool\n      </span>\n      <p style=\"margin:0.8rem 0 0; max-width: 28ch;\">A weekly planner for small teams who would rather agree than argue.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <h4>Product</h4>\n      <ul>\n        <li><a href=\"#features\">Features</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#method\">How it works</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#pricing\">Pricing</a></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <h4>Company</h4>\n      <ul>\n        <li><a href=\"#top\">About</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#top\">Journal</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#top\">Contact</a></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n      <h4>Legal</h4>\n      <ul>\n        <li><a href=\"#top\">Privacy</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#top\">Terms</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"#top\">Security</a></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"wrap\">\n    <div class=\"colophon\">\n      <span>Set in serif type on warm stock. Printed nowhere, read everywhere.</span>\n      <span>&copy; 2025 Tidepool</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n"}